{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And HaShem said, etc., One plague more, etc.</b> This passage declares what HaShem had already said beforehand. And you will find that the beginning of the plagues was the first prophecy, which was in Midian, where He said to him (Exodus 3:19): ״לֹא יִתֵּן אֶתְכֶם מֶלֶךְ מִצְרַיִם לַהֲלֹךְ וְלֹא בְּיָד חֲזָקָה וְשָׁלַחְתִּי אֶת יָדִי״ etc., and ״וְנָתַתִּי אֶת חֵן הָעָם״ etc., and ״וְשָׁאֲלָה״ etc. And a second prophecy, also in Midian, He made known to him the plague of the firstborn, as it is written (Exodus 4:22): ״בְּנִי בְכוֹרִי״ etc., and ״וַתְּמָאֵן לְשַׁלְּחוֹ הִנֵּה אָנֹכִי הֹרֵג אֶת בִּנְךָ בְּכוֹרֶךָ״ — see, in His hand is the plague of the firstborn at the end. And a third prophecy in the land of Egypt, He said to him (Exodus 7:4) — for the sign of the end of the plagues is when Pharaoh does not listen to them, meaning, that he will no longer wish to hear their words. Therefore, when He said to him ״אַל תּוֹסֶף״ etc., from this he knew that the time of the final plague had arrived, in which they would go out, and he knew it because it is the plague of the firstborn, which is equivalent to all the others, as stated to him in proximity to the commandment of ״וְשָׁאֲלָה אִשָּׁה מִשְּׁכֶנְתָּהּ״. And this is what the verse says: <b>And HaShem said: One plague more,</b> etc. — meaning, HaShem had already said ״עוֹד״ etc., that is, what He had written in the earlier prophecies as I have noted. Therefore Moses said immediately to Pharaoh: ״כֹּה אָמַר ה׳ כַּחֲצוֹת הַלַּיְלָה״ etc. And even though we do not find that HaShem said to him there this detail of ״at midnight,״ the unspecified may be inferred from the explicit — for so the matters were there, except that He was brief; and from its own place you learn that HaShem indeed said this to him. From this point on, this prophecy was not spoken in Egypt. Nor is it difficult why HaShem would command twice concerning the borrowing of vessels from Egypt."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:26:41.894299472Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}